WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:06.937
"I can still get that power crystal back," Cozlin said.

2
00:00:06.938 --> 00:00:12.023
Detective Borzon frowned. "But it's on another planet!"

3
00:00:12.024 --> 00:00:16.699
Cozlin laughed. "I'm a superhero, Detective.

4
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.387
I can do anything I want!"

5
00:00:20.388 --> 00:00:24.946
"Take this." Quazz handed Cozlin a small device.

6
00:00:24.947 --> 00:00:30.091
"It's a tracker. It will track the crystal."

7
00:00:30.092 --> 00:00:40.618
"Thanks!" Cozlin flew high above Delkor.

8
00:00:40.619 --> 00:00:45.426
The tracker showed her which direction to fly.

9
00:00:45.427 --> 00:00:50.236
Zoom! She shot through space.

10
00:00:50.237 --> 00:00:54.587
Soon she saw a blue and green planet.

11
00:00:54.588 --> 00:01:00.525
"That's the alien planet," Cozlin thought.

12
00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.610
The tracker led her to a big city.

13
00:01:02.611 --> 00:01:04.653
Aliens were everywhere.

14
00:01:04.654 --> 00:01:11.261
"This place is strange," Cozlin thought.

15
00:01:11.262 --> 00:01:13.650
She arrived at a huge building.

16
00:01:13.651 --> 00:01:16.665
She saw lots of rockets.

17
00:01:16.666 --> 00:01:20.675
A sign read Metro City Space Agency.

18
00:01:20.676 --> 00:01:22.535
The tracker beeped.

19
00:01:22.536 --> 00:01:30.750
Cozlin grinned. "The power crystal is inside this building!" she thought.

20
00:01:30.751 --> 00:01:34.037
She walked toward a wall.

21
00:01:34.038 --> 00:01:38.603
Zimp! Cozlin slipped through the wall.

22
00:01:38.604 --> 00:01:43.246
She hurried down a hallway and into a room.

23
00:01:43.247 --> 00:01:46.598
Two aliens were studying the power crystal.

24
00:01:46.599 --> 00:01:51.061
"This crystal is very interesting," one alien said.

25
00:01:51.062 --> 00:01:56.163
"I wonder what it does," the other alien said.

26
00:01:56.164 --> 00:02:01.659
Zoom! Cozlin moved so fast, she was invisible.

27
00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:07.519
One alien gasped. "The crystal just disappeared!"

28
00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:10.396
An alarm went off.

29
00:02:10.397 --> 00:02:12.946
Aliens ran into the room.

30
00:02:12.947 --> 00:02:15.487
Cozlin stopped for a second.

31
00:02:15.488 --> 00:02:17.061
One alien saw her.

32
00:02:17.062 --> 00:02:22.957
"There's the thief!" he yelled.

33
00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:25.445
"She's fast," someone said.

34
00:02:25.446 --> 00:02:28.198
"Call Rocket Girl!"

35
00:02:28.199 --> 00:02:32.381
Cozlin moved through another wall. Zimp!

36
00:02:32.382 --> 00:02:36.259
When she got outside, she saw lots of vehicles.

37
00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:38.955
One vehicle had a weapon!

38
00:02:38.956 --> 00:02:42.792
Zap! Cozlin shot a laser from her hand.

39
00:02:42.793 --> 00:02:48.870
Boom! The vehicle's weapon exploded.

40
00:02:48.871 --> 00:02:52.294
An alien climbed out of the vehicle.

41
00:02:52.295 --> 00:02:57.000
"Now I'll go home!" Cozlin started to fly away.

42
00:02:57.001 --> 00:03:00.788
Whiz-hoo! Laser beams hit her.

43
00:03:00.789 --> 00:03:03.776
"Ouch!" Cozlin looked back.

44
00:03:03.777 --> 00:03:05.951
An alien flew toward her.

45
00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:10.505
The alien wore a blue suit and a cape.

46
00:03:10.506 --> 00:03:16.977
"Nobody shoots me!" Cozlin said. "I'm Kid Comet!"

47
00:03:16.978 --> 00:03:22.898
"Well, I'm Rocket Girl!" Roxy said. "And you're a thief!"

48
00:03:22.899 --> 00:03:26.144
"I'm not a thief!" Cozlin said.

49
00:03:26.145 --> 00:03:30.154
Zap! Cozlin shot another laser.

50
00:03:30.155 --> 00:03:32.718
It knocked Roxy backward.

51
00:03:32.719 --> 00:03:35.189
Cozlin flew away.

52
00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:38.204
But Roxy soon caught up to her.

53
00:03:38.205 --> 00:03:41.879
The two superheroes fought in the air.

54
00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:45.474
Bam! They slammed onto a street.

55
00:03:45.475 --> 00:03:48.925
As Cozlin stood up, Roxy blew hard.

56
00:03:48.926 --> 00:03:54.838
Whoosh! Cozlin rolled backward.

57
00:03:54.839 --> 00:04:00.314
"Grr!" Cozlin held up her hand again. Zap!

58
00:04:00.315 --> 00:04:03.879
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

59
00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:06.787
The laser beams hit each other and exploded.

60
00:04:06.788 --> 00:04:11.922
Ka-boom! Cozlin fell backward and so did Roxy.

61
00:04:11.923 --> 00:04:14.409
A building started to fall over.

62
00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:21.891
Everyone inside screamed. "Help!"

